# Source is text, and has to be diffed as text.
#
# `DataTable.jsx` carried a literal NUL byte in its search separator, which is
# how git classifies a file as binary: `git diff` printed "Bin 9519 -> 14416
# bytes" for the one component every list page in this console renders through,
# `grep -r` reported "binary file matches" instead of the line, and a review UI
# showed the change as an opaque blob. The byte is now written as an escape —
# this is what stops the next one from hiding a diff before anyone notices.
*.js  diff
*.jsx diff
*.css diff
*.md  diff
